{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it, with the number of items at the top. Five lines, each with a picture placeholder, its price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing the line at zero): Bananas 1 kg $2.50 x1, Whole milk 2 L $3.20 x2, Sourdough loaf $4.50 x1, Free-range eggs $5.00 x1, Cheddar $7.00 x1. A promo code field where SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal, delivery of $4.99, and the subtotal, promo and total kept up to date as I change things. Confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"Review before placing\" icon:\"shopping_basket\" status:\"{length(cart)} items\" (\n  state cart=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 kg\",\"price\":2.5,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"2 L\",\"price\":3.2,\"qty\":2},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"detail\":\"1 loaf\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"detail\":\"12 pack\",\"price\":5.0,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Cheddar\",\"detail\":\"400 g\",\"price\":7.0,\"qty\":1}]\n  state promo=\"\"\n  state decided=\"\"\n  state sub=sum(cart,x=>x.price*x.qty)\n  state discount=promo==\"SAVE10\"?sub*0.1:0\n  state total=sub-discount+4.99\n  each x in cart\n    CartLine x.name x.detail x.price*x.qty kind:\"box\" qty:=x.qty -> cart=removeWhere(updateWhere(cart,c=>c.id==x.id,c=>with(c,\"qty\",result)),c=>c.qty==0)\n  Input \"Promo code\" \"Enter code\" =promo\n  Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sub,\"$\",2)],[\"Promo SAVE10\",money(-discount,\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\",\"$4.99\"]]\n  TotalBar \"Total\" \"Delivery included\" amount:=money(total,\"$\",2) cta \"Confirm\" -> decided=\"confirmed\"\n  Row gap:10\n    ActionButton \"Cancel\" quiet -> decided=\"cancelled\"\n    ActionButton \"Confirm order\" primary -> decided=\"confirmed\"\n  if decided==\"confirmed\"\n    Receipt \"Order placed\" \"Your groceries are on the way.\" code:\"ORDER-1042\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n  if decided==\"cancelled\"\n    Receipt \"Order cancelled\" \"Nothing was charged.\" tone:neutral icon:\"close\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9139,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":709,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":652,"totalMs":3022}}
